{
  "$schema": "../../../schema/jwsim-test-1.json",
  "$comment": "Ethernet automático + display. (1) El servidor DHCP guionado responde OFFER y ACK (xid 0x394, el que genera el firmware con la semilla por defecto; MAC 02:4A:57:C4:0A:24) con 192.168.250.10/24, puerta de enlace y DNS 192.168.250.1. Se ve 'Display ready' una vez, DHCP pending y luego OK con la IP ofrecida y Link UP. (2) Sin W5500 (--no-eth): el display sigue funcionando y Ethernet informa No Ethernet hardware.",
  "sketch": "package:libraries/JWPLC_Ethernet/examples/Ethernet_Display_Status",
  "runs": [
    {
      "until_ms": 7000,
      "stim": [
        "2800 net 0 udp 192.168.250.1:67 ",
        "4000 net 0 udp 192.168.250.1:67 "
      ],
      "expect": {
        "console": [
          "^Ethernet_Display_Status$",
          "^Runtime auto Ethernet \\+ Display test\\. No begin\\(\\) called\\.$",
          {
            "match": "^Display ready$",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: Not started \\| Enabled: yes \\| Attempted: no \\| Ready: no \\|",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: DHCP pending \\| Enabled: yes \\| Attempted: yes \\| Ready: no \\| Link: UP \\| IP: 0\\.0\\.0\\.0$",
            "min": 1,
            "before_ms": 4500
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: OK \\| Enabled: yes \\| Attempted: yes \\| Ready: yes \\| Link: UP \\| IP: 192\\.168\\.250\\.10$",
            "min": 2,
            "after_ms": 4500
          }
        ],
        "console_absent": [
          "DHCP failed"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "until_ms": 5000,
      "args": [
        "--no-eth"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "console": [
          {
            "match": "^Display ready$",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "match": "^ETH: No Ethernet hardware \\| Enabled: yes \\| Attempted: yes \\| Ready: no \\| Link: DOWN \\|",
            "min": 2
          }
        ],
        "console_absent": [
          "Ready: yes"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
